{"3349980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BrebeMan", "steam_appid": 3349980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4607430], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world with breakbeats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, he is a superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in his true form, he is an up-and-coming DJ who keeps the clubs lively night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His name is BrebeMan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, he plays breakbeats from two records and defends the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, he never misses to proselytize breakbeat sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish this game, you will be hooked on breakbeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the true music game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BrebeMan&quot; is a 3D SHMUPS &amp; music game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the superhero “BrebeMan” and defeat the enemy “Klangeist”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disc manipulated by BrebeMan is an offensive and defensive tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times it is a blade that slices the enemy, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and at other times it is a shield that protects you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you accumulate tension, you can &quot;change the beat&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Change the Beat&quot; attacks all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful boss awaits you at the end of each stage. Face them with all your might.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music features a wide variety of club music styles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from classic to trendy, with drum'n'bass as the mainstay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive sounds that progress according to the game enhance the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with BrebeMan , various characters are represented in the collage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage, vaporwave, retro-futuristic,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and various other visuals invite you into an unknown world.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world with breakbeats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, he is a superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in his true form, he is an up-and-coming DJ who keeps the clubs lively night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His name is BrebeMan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, he plays breakbeats from two records and defends the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, he never misses to proselytize breakbeat sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish this game, you will be hooked on breakbeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the true music game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BrebeMan&quot; is a 3D SHMUPS &amp; music game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the superhero “BrebeMan” and defeat the enemy “Klangeist”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disc manipulated by BrebeMan is an offensive and defensive tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times it is a blade that slices the enemy, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and at other times it is a shield that protects you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you accumulate tension, you can &quot;change the beat&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Change the Beat&quot; attacks all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful boss awaits you at the end of each stage. Face them with all your might.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music features a wide variety of club music styles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from classic to trendy, with drum'n'bass as the mainstay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive sounds that progress according to the game enhance the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with BrebeMan , various characters are represented in the collage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage, vaporwave, retro-futuristic,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and various other visuals invite you into an unknown world.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Save the world with breakbeats.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349980/header.jpg?t=1779116607", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349980/b2234828fb7986e79ca0a883bc4eaf67ecafbe8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779116607", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349980/b2234828fb7986e79ca0a883bc4eaf67ecafbe8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779116607", "website": "https://www.wakuwakugames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© MetaFormingPro.<br />\r\nPublished by Waku Waku Games.", "developers": ["MetaFormingPro"], "publishers": ["Waku Waku Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 3759280, "description": ""}], "price_overview":